Subject: [PATCH 4/4] AttestationService: restart Play Integrity targets when
 PIF config changes

The certified props are applied when DroidGuard or the Play Store starts,
so kill those processes when pif_data changes, or when fetched_pif changes
while no user config overrides it (as crDroid's AxSpoofManagerService does).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Iaeca4b6f8119a930bd0d39688cbe5681a9a9a227
---
